{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/wordnetandlexicalgraphs"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/WordNetAndLexicalGraphs"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Navigate semantic relationships, compute synset distances, and explore English hypernym\/hyponym trees.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"WordNet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a large lexical database of English where nouns, verbs, adjectives, and adverbs are organized into sets of cognitive synonyms called ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Synsets","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", interlinked by conceptual-semantic and lexical relations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"1. Looking Up Synsets & Definitions","anchor":"1-Looking-Up-Synsets--Definitions","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftNLP","","let wordnet = WordNet.shared","","\/\/ Look up all noun synsets for \"bank\"","let synsets = wordnet.synsets(for: \"bank\", pos: .noun)","for s in synsets {","    print(\"ID: \\(s.id), Definition: \\(s.definition)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"2. Semantic Similarity Metrics","type":"heading","anchor":"2-Semantic-Similarity-Metrics","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftSci implements standard lexical similarity algorithms:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Path Similarity","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Shortest path distance in the hypernym taxonomy:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Formula:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Sim_path